      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.41 (down from ₹4.22 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹217.6m (down 20% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹30.9m (down 43% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 20% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 5% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
